{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/929016-kindred-the-embraced-retrospective","id":929016,"title":"Kindred: The Embraced retrospective","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-09T19:11:00-07:00","id":929016,"title":"Kindred: The Embraced retrospective","content":"I just re-watched this show.<br /> <br /> Wow, so much potential.<br /> <br /> So...so...many flaws.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://unitedfederationofcharles.blogspot.com/2016/07/kindred-embraced-review.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://unitedfederationofcharles.blogspot.com/2016/07/kindred-embraced-review.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://unitedfederationofcharles.blogspot.com/2016/07/kindred-embraced-review.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://unitedfederationofcharles.blogspot.com/2016/07/kindred-embraced-review.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-10T04:08:13-07:00","id":929168,"title":"","content":"I remember this coming out on Fox during V:TM height of popularity. The show was OK, my biggest issue was it wasn\u2019t exactly like how WOD was in the Game such as the didn\u2019t play up the Anarch Free State aspect and Clans Malkavian and Tremere were all together missing from the show. But such is with any adaptation right?<br /> <br /> But the series was doomed, I think Fox thought they would capitalize on the popularity of Interview with a Vampire being still recent and relevant and it just didn\u2019t happen. Ratings were not that good, tabletop still had a bad stigma attached to it, (worse than today,) and the death of Mark Frankel didn\u2019t help keep the project going as well.<br /> <br /> I do think the series was pretty good. It was more entertaining than most of the shows on TV at the time, (the era of Friends and Home Improvement.) It just want meant to be, I am curious how much White Wolf and or Mark Rein-Hagen actually had to invest in the show and if they had to suffer any losses at the time because of it. I remember a lot of supplements came out with stickers on the covers promoting the show. Mark was listed as a Producer of the show as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11846-atomichammer","name":"AtomicHammer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11846_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-10T04:27:42-07:00","id":929184,"title":"","content":"Interestingly, the series had been renewed on Showtime with them believing themselves (undoubtedly correctly) a better fit for a vampire show than Fox.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-10T04:49:54-07:00","id":929190,"title":"","content":"If that was the case, they could also get away with more mature themes as well. But with anything regarding TV and Movies, talk is cheap. There are a million dead projects that were supposed to be made that never get done.<br /> <br /> Don\u2019t get me wrong, I would have loved to see it. But most adaptations from RPG to TV or Movies always end badly. <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11846-atomichammer","name":"AtomicHammer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11846_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-10T11:13:02-07:00","id":929283,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AtomicHammer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/929016-kindred-the-embraced-retrospective?p=929190#post929190\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If that was the case, they could also get away with more mature themes as well. But with anything regarding TV and Movies, talk is cheap. There are a million dead projects that were supposed to be made that never get done.<br /> <br /> Don\u2019t get me wrong, I would have loved to see it. But most adaptations from RPG to TV or Movies always end badly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey, the Dungeons and Dragons movie was just delightful. In a so bad it's good way, but still.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T09:53:22-07:00","id":930390,"title":"","content":"I had so much hope for the show, saw how they botched the portrayals of multiple clans, was surprisingly not disappointed when it was cancelled. Aaron Spelling just wrecked the concept, who the fuck wanted to watch Melrose Kindred 90210?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T10:23:59-07:00","id":930404,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darksider</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/929016-kindred-the-embraced-retrospective?p=930390#post930390\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I had so much hope for the show, saw how they botched the portrayals of multiple clans, was surprisingly not disappointed when it was cancelled. Aaron Spelling just wrecked the concept, who the fuck wanted to watch Melrose Kindred 90210?</div> </div> </div> </div>I am curious how you can botch the depiction of clans. I heard a bunch of people go, &quot;Oh my God, the Brujah are mobsters!&quot;<br /> <br /> Yeah, so?<br /> <br /> Why can't this group of Brujah be mobsters?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&am