les-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T16:43:54-07:00","id":930586,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/929016-kindred-the-embraced-retrospective?p=930404#post930404\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I am curious how you can botch the depiction of clans. I heard a bunch of people go, &quot;Oh my God, the Brujah are mobsters!&quot;<br /> <br /> Yeah, so?<br /> <br /> Why can't this group of Brujah be mobsters?</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bEvery Clan had Protean 2. Every. Fucking. One. Gangrel were all biker wannabes who kissed the Prince's ass and didn't suffer the Clan flaw from the game, all Brujah were portrayed as a mix between Giovanni and Ravnos in look and behavior (and had a mutual instinctual hatred of the Gangrel for literally no reason whatsoever), No feeding restrictions for Ventrue, Nosferatu were just slightly weird looking bald dudes unless they got really pissed off, then they were ugly weird looking bald dudes with big teeth. They weren't using Mask of 1000 Faces to hide their disfigurements, they were mainly just bald. Toreador were about the only ones that seemed reasonably close in presentation to the way they were presented in the game. That's how you botch their presentation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T16:48:10-07:00","id":930589,"title":"","content":"I thought the nosferatu make-up wasn't that great but it's to be expected for the first season. They seemed to be going for this imagery.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://www.victoriangothic.org/wp-content/uploads/2012/02/nosferatu11_small.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> The only really bad part of the show was the cop.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T20:12:53-07:00","id":930677,"title":"","content":"I never really understood why they decided to call it Kindred: the Embraced. That doesn't actually tell you anything about the show and its not snappy or attention-getting either. If they had at least called the show Bloodsucker: the Fang-ening or something they probably would have drawn in more viewers. <br /> <br /> The problem with the show overall is that it neither gets the material right nor works as an interesting show in its own right. It could have still been terrible but drawn in a cult audience of fans with enough setting nods, and even stripping out the canon it could have been a decent show with interesting plotlines if it had bothered.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T20:30:35-07:00","id":930685,"title":"","content":"I don't believe they were trying to wholly adhere to the material. It was meant to be a dark soap opera, inspired by the setting of Vampire the Masquerade, not a tabletop campaign brought to TV.<br /> <br /> I do think you could manage something like that now, considering networks like SyFy and Chiller and the various online streaming services making their original content. The Showtime thing seems like it could have kept it alive, if the Prince didn't die. Arli$$ made it far, far, far too long on HBO because they could do that sort of thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 07-12-2016, 11:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}